#13502
Labyrinth: Out of My Depth~
   At first, there's no movement, as if the adventurer in the corner hopes you
haven't noticed them. There's a moment of awkward silence, and then a glance
over the shoulder.
   'I was worried you were that madman again,' the meek adventurer says. 'That
will be me before long if I don't get out of here. I thought it was just a
little ruin on the hillside, next thing I know I'm sliding down a dark chute
and then... this. Just this. This maddening place.'
   There's a heavy sigh.
   'If you can get me out of here, I'll owe you one. Maybe several. What do you
say?'
   Use 'finish Out of My Depth' to accept and gain the meek adventurer as a
permanent companion, or 'quest drop Out of My Depth' to decline.
~
   'You won't regret this,' says the meek adventurer, getting up.
   Use the 'companion' command to summon the meek adventurer.
~
