#13503
Labyrinth: Free to a Good Home~
   'Oh, let's talk again when we get out,' the adventurer adds.
   Use the 'companion' command to summon the meek adventurer when you're
outside the labyrinth in order to complete this quest.
~
   'I never thought I'd get out of there. I can't possibly thank you enough,'
the adventurer says. 'You're a good friend for this. I'll stick around as long
as you'll have me. One favor, though. I found this little guy in the dark and
I can't really afford to feed him. I missed so much work while I was stuck down
there. Think you can give him a good home?'
   A cream-white dog peers out from behind the adventurer and looks up at you
with the biggest, saddest eyes you've ever seen.
~
