#13510
Labyrinth: The Only Way Out Is Through~
   Nevermind the maze, nevermind the darkness, nevermind the horrors. The
labyrinth holds a minotaur! There's real glory to be had in taking on a mythic
creature. They'll sing stories of this battle... if you survive.
~
   A cloud of ash billows out from beneath the minotaur as he collapses to the
chamber floor, dead. Silence washes down the walls and across the floor. True
silence. No scurry, no creaks, no thudding footfalls.
   Silence.
   And with the minotaur dead, you can finally reach the ladder out. Not a
moment too soon. This place feels like a tomb.
~
