#13515
Labyrinth: Sealed Away~
   Though you can make little sense of the torn page, the marginal notes seem
to suggest something is sealed away in some kind of urn or jar. Whoever wrote
those notes must also have been the person who tore the page from the book for
reference. But the page was enchanted to be immovable and you cannot take it
along -- or even see the other side -- so you will have to figure this one out
on your own.
   The notes suggested three seals must be broken: the blood seal, the water
seal, and the fiend seal.
   It doesn't indicate how.
   The author seemed to think they were onto something, but those notes were
long-abandoned. Did the author break the seals and abscond with the treasure?
Or did they meet some other fate in the dark?
   The only way to find out is to break the seals. And then you'll just have to
find the correct jar... and open it.
~
   All three seals are broken and the great jar is open! But perhaps the power
contained therein isn't what you were expecting...
~
